\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For every Noetherian regular local domain A with fraction field F, is the canonical map on integral algebraic K-groups $K_{5}(A)\to K_{5}(F)$ injective, including ramified mixed characteristic?

\subsection{Short English statement}
For every Noetherian regular local domain A with fraction field F, is the canonical map on integral algebraic K-groups $K_{5}(A)\to K_{5}(F)$ injective, including ramified mixed characteristic?

